{"card_hash": "454be8c0c919e894040964c5b0b5fe2b5b7086388893cfe1337fee46de7e5336", "channel": "Vercel", "chars": 9974, "chars_all_clips": 9974, "chars_chosen_clips": 1440, "clip_count": 10, "clips": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=2s", "end": 70.71, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "798bc9dd0c955e6765be46e8cce8f3f3045ff4f1353d64b16196dabd2417a913", "start": 2.149, "text": "Millions of developers have built on Verscell's front-end cloud for over a decade. And we've all been using Verscell to deploy everything from personal projects to enterprise software. And when you're building agents and AI features to redu", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=131s", "end": 199.35, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e5fb260e4cab117e4c0ebe6e7a7d64427ed0ebda08c5107bf015ec795998e015", "start": 131.35, "text": "app so that it can talk to Superbase. Great. Now my app can talk to Subabase. And for the fast API variable, I'll add the URL I just copied and I'll deploy the app. Verscel is building and deploying the project. And this will run on the sam", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=245s", "end": 312.79, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "b56031ef0bb1c95a0b7625a3e87f6a9d131b666cf604508e82b2357504bb3890", "start": 245.99, "text": "connect my local project to Verscell. The CLI makes it easy for me to control the Verscell platform right from my command line. I'll start with Verscell link. Yeah, I'm going to link this local project. It'll be the Vcel demo or the coffee ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=312s", "end": 360.23, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "53265a1592733c0490829a867cc289b30cc807bcfb4c71f03996e9029ca523b9", "start": 312.79, "text": "install AI. Great. After that, I'm going to install the workflow devkit, which will durably orchestrate each step the agent takes. If my app was generating code, I could also use the Vcel sandbox to run it safely. But this is a simple summa", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=407s", "end": 472.87, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "773ee56642067867d2c768396716a006d935e4da28388f61e2773509ee70a684", "start": 407.35, "text": "branch that I'm working on. Now, Verscell's self-driving infrastructure is going to automatically recognize the AI workloads and provision infrastructure for those compute jobs and active compute pricing is really great here. I'm only going", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=519s", "end": 612.08, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "a7596e500736c326f1c3ebdd4352f81b78236997d8c0d0da6f5e4826af9c41a6", "start": 519.029, "text": "created a new branch for me to work on. I want to adjust the jobs page design just a bit. This might be crazy, but let's make the job cards full width on the page. Vzero cooked on that. And huh, I don't love that choice that I've made, but ", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}], "current_topic": "AI and ML", "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpts": [{"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=2s", "end": 70.71, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "798bc9dd0c955e6765be46e8cce8f3f3045ff4f1353d64b16196dabd2417a913", "start": 2.149, "text": "Millions of developers have built on Verscell's front-end cloud for over a decade. And we've all been using Verscell to deploy everything from personal projects to enterprise software. And when you're building agents and AI features to redu", "timing": "source_cues", "truncated": true}, {"deep_link": "https://youtube.com/watch?v=zFXscjUoDDA\u0026t=131s", "end": 199.35, "evidence_kind": "timed_clip", "excerpt_id": "e5fb260e4cab117e4c0ebe6e7a